Use WebApi\cBaseRestDataset.pkg
Use WebApi\cOpenApiSpecification.pkg

Class cOpenApiEndpoint is a cBaseRestDataset

    Procedure Construct_Object
        Forward Send Construct_Object

        Set pbReadOnly to True
        Set pbInheritSecurity to False
        Set psPath to "OpenApi"

        Object oOpenApiGenerator is a cOpenApiSpecification
        End_Object

    End_Procedure

    Procedure OnHttpGet tWebApiCallContext ByRef webapicallcontext
        Handle hoSpec

        Get GenerateOpenApiSpecJson of oOpenApiGenerator to hoSpec
        If (hoSpec = 0) Begin
            Move True to webapicallcontext.bErr
            Move 500 to webapicallcontext.iStatusCode
            Move "Internal Server Error" to webapicallcontext.sShortStatusMessage
            Move "The OpenAPI specification could not be generated." to webapicallcontext.sErrorMessage
            Procedure_Return
        End

        If (webapicallcontext.hoResponseBody <> 0) Send Destroy of webapicallcontext.hoResponseBody
        Move hoSpec to webapicallcontext.hoResponseBody
        Move C_WEBAPI_OK to webapicallcontext.iStatusCode
        Move "OK" to webapicallcontext.sShortStatusMessage
    End_Procedure
End_Class
